taris-appledrm-dkms

The Apple display driver (drivers/gpu/drm/apple) from Asahi Linux's kernel source, tag
asahi-7.1.13-3 (https://github.com/AsahiLinux/linux), by the Asahi Linux contributors. Licensed
under the GNU General Public License version 2; most of its files may also be used under the MIT
licence, as their SPDX lines say.

Changed by TarisOS (https://github.com/TarisOS/tarisOS) in 2026, in
0001-drm-apple-a-late-clear-swap-at-power-off-is-not-a-DCP-crash.patch (Christian Bartels's fix):
a USB-C display unplugged while on no longer leaves the display processor marked as crashed.
iomfb_template.c, the file it changes, says so near its top (taris-notices.patch). Both patches
are in TarisOS's source, packaging/pkgbuilds/taris-appledrm-dkms.
